Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 03:18:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(core): planDailyUsage daily pace planner (RR05)

Three-part dashboard formula ported from codex-cockpit dynamicQuota.ts
planCalibratedRiskQuota (dq:149-165): uniform pace + p^2 risk pull-forward
+ soft cap K(1+1.5r) with 0.75 weekend factor. Weekend inferred from
beijingWeekday (D004). Factors follow D006 (id/label/delta/note) and sum
to suggested. 15 domain tests incl. both dashboard golden examples.
---
